    "headline": "Brookfield to invest up to $600 million in ACME’s green molecules business",
    "body": "Brookfield will invest up to $600 million in ACME Cleantech Ventures. This investment supports green molecules projects in India and the Middle East. ACME Cleantech Ventures is developing green ammonia and methanol projects. The company has secured offtake partnerships with several global firms. This funding will expand ACME's green molecules platform significantly.",
