    "headline": "NMDC recovers 27.29-carat diamond at Panna site, its second-largest yet",
    "body": "NMDC Panna has recovered a significant 27.29-carat gem-quality diamond. This discovery marks the second-largest diamond ever found at the Panna mine. The find follows a 13.16-carat diamond recovered earlier in July. NMDC operates India's only mechanized diamond mine in Panna, Madhya Pradesh. The company is also India's largest iron ore producer.",
