    "headline": "Micron to scale up India chip assembly multifold next year as semiconductor mission shifts to execution",
    "body": "Micron CEO Sanjay Mehrotra said the company will scale up semiconductor assembly and testing at its Sanand facility multifold next year, as India’s semiconductor policy push moves from vision to execution. Speaking at SEMICON India 2026, he said the company’s India operations are supporting jobs, global memory-chip production and growing AI-driven demand.",
