    "headline": "SEMICON India 2026: India’s chip story has moved from files to factories, says PM Modi",
    "body": "India's semiconductor sector is now moving towards commercial production. Prime Minister Modi inaugurated SEMICON India 2026, highlighting this significant shift. The government is encouraging more private sector investment in research and development. India aims to become a preferred global destination for chip manufacturing. Further reforms are being introduced to widen participation in the sector.",
