    "headline": "From phones to fabs: India is building its semiconductor muscle",
    "body": "India's semiconductor strategy is widening from fabs to a complete ecosystem. The nation is building capabilities across design, packaging, and manufacturing. Significant government investment supports this comprehensive semiconductor value chain development. This push aligns with a growing electronics manufacturing base and global supply chain shifts. The focus is on connecting all pieces to become a durable global participant.",
