    "headline": "India’s Semicon 2.0 should go beyond chip fabs, focus on design, packaging: Chris Miller",
    "body": "India's semiconductor strategy should broaden beyond fabrication to include design and equipment. Advanced packaging offers another significant area for India to build capabilities. Deep integration into global value chains is essential for any successful strategy. This approach combines existing design talent with manufacturing and packaging investments. India can strengthen its global semiconductor position by developing specialized capabilities.",
