    "headline": "Online sales of mobiles &amp; laptops hit a rough patch on weaker entry-level demand, fewer online discounts",
    "body": "Counterpoint Research data showed an almost identical drop in online contribution to smartphone sales. Researchers and industry executives attributed the reversal to weaker demand for entry-level products, fewer online discounts and wider availability of EMI financing at physical stores.",
