      "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/banking/finance/banking/rbi-clarifies-principal-business-rules-for-nbfcs-cic-definition-after-tata-sons-cor-rejection/articleshow/134296053.cms",
      "publisher": "Economic Times",
