    "headline": "MDR on UPI transactions faces PIL in Supreme Court",
    "body": "A Public Interest Litigation challenges the government's new UPI charges. These charges apply to merchant payments exceeding two thousand rupees. The petition argues these new fees will ultimately affect ordinary citizens. Businesses might pass these additional costs directly to consumers. The Supreme Court will now review this significant financial move.",
