    "headline": "Delhi Airport ranks No 28 in world's most-connected international airports list",
    "body": "Delhi airport secured a strong position at 28th globally. This marks the highest ranking for an Indian airport in the report. Mumbai airport also showed significant connectivity in its category. IndiGo played a major role in flights at both airports. These airports serve as India's primary international gateways.",
