    "headline": "India slashes windfall tax on petrol, diesel, ATF exports",
    "body": "The government has reduced windfall taxes on petroleum exports. Levies on petrol, diesel, and aviation turbine fuel have been lowered. This change follows the government's regular fortnightly review of export duties. The duty on petrol exports is now Rs. 0.5 per litre. Diesel and ATF exports will see duties of Rs. 20 and Rs. 15 per litre respectively.",
