    "headline": "Government reviews use of ship-recycled steel to boost manufacturing",
    "body": "Ministers reviewed using ship recycling steel to boost domestic production. Key stakeholders examined regulations for secondary steel usage. Discussions focused on expanding recycled steel applications to new sectors. This aims to enhance value generation from ship recycling operations. The government promotes circular economy and sustainable global benchmarks.",
