    "headline": "SC asks RBI to secure compliance of norms on seizure of financed vehicles by NBFCs, banks",
    "body": "The Supreme Court mandated the RBI to enforce lawful vehicle repossession rules. Financial institutions cannot seize vehicles without due legal process. The court ordered a finance firm to close loan accounts and refund money. Compensation was awarded for mental agony and livelihood loss. This ruling ensures borrowers are not dispossessed of vehicles arbitrarily.",
