    "source": {
      "name": "Economic Times",
      "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/economy/finance/epf-wage-ceiling-hiked-to-rs-25000-how-much-employees-gain-and-what-it-costs-the-government/articleshow/134286227.cms",
      "publisher": "Economic Times",
      "collectionMethod": "RSS"
    },
    "sourceUrl": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/economy/finance/epf-wage-ceiling-hiked-to-rs-25000-how-much-employees-gain-and-what-it-costs-the-government/articleshow/134286227.cms",
    "headline": "EPF wage ceiling hiked to Rs 25,000: How much employees gain and what it costs the government",
    "body": "In a significant move, the government has lifted the provident fund wage ceiling to Rs 25,000 monthly, bringing over 51 lakh new employees into the fold of social security. This adjustment is projected to cost the Centre Rs 11,339 crore annually. As a result, more individuals will benefit from mandatory coverage, but employers should prepare for an increase in obligatory contributions once the changes take effect.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-16T11:37:09.000Z",
