    "headline": "ET Masterclass vs other online learning platforms: What makes it different?",
    "body": "ET Masterclass differentiates itself in the crowded online learning market by focusing on practical application and real-world relevance for professionals and business leaders. It offers diverse learning formats, including live sessions and immersive experiences, taught by recognized experts and industry practitioners. The platform emphasizes actionable frameworks and case studies to help learners translate knowledge into effective decision-making for evolving career and business landscapes.",
