    "headline": "Global Market: Japan’s Nikkei swings as AI stocks slip ahead of Nvidia results",
    "body": "Japan’s Nikkei swung between gains and losses on Monday as investors turned cautious ahead of Nvidia’s earnings this week. AI-related stocks came under pressure amid concerns over rising costs, while higher bond yields and inflation worries added to uncertainty. Expectations of a Bank of Japan rate hike further weighed on sentiment.",
