    "headline": "Global Market: KOSPI drops over 1% as Samsung Electronics slumps on payout concerns",
    "body": "South Korean shares fell over 1% on Monday, dragged by a sharp decline in Samsung Electronics after its latest shareholder return plans disappointed investors. The KOSPI slipped 1.31%, while foreign investors remained net sellers. Gains in SK Hynix, LG Energy Solution and POSCO Holdings offered some support.",
