    "headline": "ET World Leaders Forum: Cricket is a great investment but rights costs have run out of control, says JioStar's Uday Shankar",
    "body": "JioStar vice chairman Uday Shankar said sports, particularly cricket, has been a major investment for the company, helping it build a digital audience of 600 million monthly active users. However, he said soaring cricket media rights costs have made the business increasingly difficult.",
