    "headline": "RBI board gets three new part-time directors",
    "body": "The Appointments Committee of the Cabinet (ACC) has approved the appointment of Annie George Mathew, Syed Akbaruddin and Janmejaya Kumar Sinha as part-time non-official directors on the Reserve Bank of India’s central board for four years.",
